commit: 58bcf89a121b72d4fb66334f1693d3b30e4cb9c5 (master, 2022-09-22)
Copied: src/*.c (minus CMakeLists.txt), include/**. Added: src/fd_blockdev.c, include/fd_blockdev.h.

Licensing: BSD-style per-file headers, EXCEPT src/ext4_extent.c and src/ext4_xattr.c
which are GPL-2.0-or-later (see LICENSE). include/misc/{queue,tree}.h are BSD.

Patches (all minimal):
1. include/ext4_config.h: default CONFIG_USE_DEFAULT_CFG to 1 when undefined
   (Clang module import of the C target does not see SwiftPM -D defines).
2. Package.swift does NOT pass CONFIG_META_CSUM_ENABLE: ext4_config.h already
   derives it from the feature set (macro-redefined warning otherwise).
3. Read path, csum_seed: trixie mkfs with -U (and any tune2fs -U'd fs) sets
   INCOMPAT_CSUM_SEED (0x2000), which lwext4 rejected with ENOTSUP at mount.
   - include/ext4_types.h: EXT4_SUPPORTED_FINCOM += EXT4_FINCOM_BG_USE_META_CSUM
     (same 0x2000 bit); sblock padding[100] -> prj_quota_inum, checksum_seed, padding[98]
     (offsets verified: checksum_seed 0x270, checksum stays 0x3fc).
   - include/ext4_super.h: new static inline ext4_sb_csum_seed(sb).
   - src/ext4_{balloc,dir,dir_idx,ialloc,fs,extent,xattr}.c: replace
     ext4_crc32c(EXT4_CRC32_INIT, sb->uuid, sizeof(sb->uuid)) with ext4_sb_csum_seed(sb).
     (journal uuid uses in ext4_journal.c untouched.)
Note: orphan_file (COMPAT) needs no patch; lwext4 does not check compat bits.
